WEBVTT

00:15.570 --> 00:18.400
I never dreamed before

00:18.400 --> 00:21.240
I'm gonna knock the door

00:21.240 --> 00:24.810
into the world of perfect free

00:24.810 --> 00:26.910
(You ain't no lonely!)

00:26.910 --> 00:29.750
You're gonna say I'm lying

00:29.750 --> 00:32.480
I'm gonna get the chance

00:32.480 --> 00:36.050
I thought a chance is far from me

00:36.050 --> 00:37.220
(You ain't no lonely!)

00:37.220 --> 00:40.130
I was made to hit in America

00:40.130 --> 00:42.990
(I was made to hit in America)

00:42.990 --> 00:48.900
I was made to hit in America

00:48.900 --> 00:52.570
You are the sun, you are the star

00:52.570 --> 00:54.570
(To me, forever)

00:54.570 --> 00:58.280
You are the sun, you are the star

00:58.280 --> 01:01.510
(To me, forever)

01:08.350 --> 01:13.960
I was made to hit in America

