04:28.790 --> 04:29.450
-Open up the door with negative aura

04:29.450 --> 04:31.120
-But still, it's not Lucille,

04:29.450 --> 04:31.120
-Open up the door with negative aura

04:31.120 --> 04:32.060
-But still, it's not Lucille,

04:31.120 --> 04:32.060
-If you never change

04:32.060 --> 04:34.460
-and Ryusuke isn't entirely satisfied.

04:32.060 --> 04:34.460
-I think there is no way my life

04:34.460 --> 04:36.730
-From our jam sessions
based on Ryusuke's riffs,

04:34.460 --> 04:36.730
-fizzle out

04:36.730 --> 04:39.560
we've come up with
this song, "Brainstorm."

04:39.560 --> 04:41.470
-This is our most powerful

04:39.560 --> 04:41.470
-You open up the door
with negative aura

04:41.470 --> 04:43.170
-and best song yet.

04:41.470 --> 04:43.170
