04:54.980 --> 04:56.150
-Should we release a new CD by this Fall?

04:56.150 --> 04:57.420
-What!?
-What!?
-What!?

04:57.420 --> 04:58.780
Hey, Ryusuke!

04:58.780 --> 05:01.590
We don't have any feature songs.

05:01.590 --> 05:04.260
You want to do a collection of covers?

05:04.260 --> 05:06.720
Nah, we're going to make new songs.

05:06.720 --> 05:07.430
Huh?

05:07.430 --> 05:12.100
We made a CD that hit the
top ten college charts in the US,

05:12.100 --> 05:15.100
it'd be sad if we didn't
release a follow-up.

05:15.100 --> 05:17.440
Well, that's your fault!

05:17.440 --> 05:19.470
Anyway...

05:19.470 --> 05:21.770
Let's make another CD.

05:21.770 --> 05:26.940
Then what are we going to do
about the Grateful Sound thing?

05:26.940 --> 05:29.450
I haven't heard back from Leon yet.

05:29.450 --> 05:33.950
Geez, I guess we can't
count on Leon, either.

05:33.950 --> 05:35.680
Well, there's nothing we can do about that.

05:37.220 --> 05:39.090
Yeah, I know, but still...

05:43.230 --> 05:45.730
-Please come see us! We're Beck!
-Please come see us!

05:45.730 --> 05:48.290
We're Beck. Please come see us!

05:49.570 --> 05:51.240
They're called "Beck."

05:51.240 --> 05:54.570
That's weird. Couldn't they
come up with a different name?

05:56.570 --> 05:58.410
I've always wondered...

05:58.410 --> 06:01.340
Is it worth passing out these flyers?

06:02.480 --> 06:04.920
It's true that these expenses do add up.

06:04.920 --> 06:08.590
It's important to get the word out.

06:08.590 --> 06:14.760
If even one person came to
see us because of this flyer,

06:14.760 --> 06:17.230
that one person could help
spread the word about us.

06:18.430 --> 06:24.270
Hi there! Our band's call Beck!
Please come see us play!

06:24.270 --> 06:25.460
What the heck's this?

06:37.220 --> 06:39.050
Wow, it's incredible...

06:43.050 --> 06:45.220
So, this is our competition today?

06:45.220 --> 06:48.060
They're called "Beck."
What a joke of a name.

06:48.060 --> 06:49.660
Hey, I read in a magazine...

06:49.660 --> 06:54.230
That kid with the cap there, he had
a bit part in that Dying Breed movie.

06:54.230 --> 06:55.230
Oh?

06:55.230 --> 06:59.240
Yeah, heard they got quite
a reception at the Whiskey a GoGo.

06:59.240 --> 07:02.740
They're probably just a poser band,
flavor of the month.

07:02.740 --> 07:06.080
It'll be tough for them to
survive here at the Marquee.

07:06.080 --> 07:09.070
It's survival of the fittest here...
These guys will probably just fade away.

07:21.260 --> 07:24.290
Uh! Yeah!

07:27.770 --> 07:31.270
You open up the door
with negative aura

07:31.270 --> 07:33.270
You say future is murky indeed...

07:33.270 --> 07:34.640
I'm sick of hearing gripe.

07:34.640 --> 07:36.270
-We might be the ones...

07:34.640 --> 07:36.270
-I'm sick of hearing gripe.

07:36.270 --> 07:36.710
-We might be the ones...

07:36.270 --> 07:36.710
-Open up the door with negative aura

07:36.710 --> 07:38.440
